# Project environment

- Local: `pnpm dev` (Vite + miniflare D1/R2). Create schema with `pnpm db:migrate:local`.
- Production: Cloudflare Worker. Create D1 `booker-orders` and R2 `booker-delivery-photos`, put the real `database_id` in `wrangler.jsonc`, run `wrangler d1 migrations apply booker-orders --remote`, set secrets with `wrangler secret put`.
- Required secrets: `SITE_ORIGIN`, `SESSION_SECRET`, `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID/SECRET`, `BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_EMAIL`, `GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY`, `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`, `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, `RESEND_API_KEY`, `NOTIFICATION_FROM_EMAIL`, optional `DEPOT_LABEL/LAT/LNG`.
- Stripe webhook endpoint: `${SITE_ORIGIN}/api/stripe-webhook`, event `checkout.session.completed`.
- Google OAuth redirect URI: `${SITE_ORIGIN}/auth/callback`.

Generic gates: `dev-checks.mdc`, `predeploy.mdc`, `pull-requests.mdc`.
